  "worked_solution": "The vertex of a left-opening parabola is the right-most point of the parabola.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14144324/assets/94d33dcb92ddb84479c1ea7b01d5619268a10786a19f318fba61f3107ba9b551.png)\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(6,4).$",
